      "category": "bug fix",
      "prompt": "`slugify.py` in the current directory is buggy. Fix it so that:\n- the docstring examples hold;\n- accented letters are transliterated to plain ASCII (`A\u00e7\u00e3o` -> `acao`, `\u00dcber` -> `uber`); characters with no ASCII equivalent are dropped;\n- there are no leading, trailing or repeated hyphens;\n- truncation to `max_len` never leaves a trailing hyphen.\n\nKeep the signature `slugify(title: str, max_len: int = 60) -> str`, use only the standard library, and add `unittest` tests in `test_slugify.py`. Do not ask questions; edit the files directly.",
